## Interface: 16001
## Title: TwizInterrupt
## Notes: Interrupts for every class: one key interrupts the enemy under your mouse (else your target) with your class's interrupt (the TwizRogue / TwizWarrior / TwizHunt / TwizMage attack keys fire it too, in a fight), and a big alert with a warning sound shows the moment your target - or an enemy near you in a fight - starts a cast you can interrupt. /interrupt
